    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42257" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρεθίμιος</span></b> , ὁ, epith.
		of Apollo in Rhodes, <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			724
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρεθίμια</span></b> , τά, his festival,
		prob. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12(1).735
		</span></i> : <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρεθειμιάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belong to a guild of worshippers
				of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ. Ἐ.,</span> Inscrr. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				61.477
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρεθύμιος, Ἐρυθίβιος,
				Ἐριδίμιος.</span></div>
